# The one secret this application needs (AD-16). Copy this file to `.env` and
# paste your own Neon connection string after the `=`.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored; this file is not, and it carries no value — nothing in
# the codebase defaults it. `src/server/repository/client.ts` and
# `drizzle.config.ts` both fail loudly naming this variable when it is unset,
# rather than failing later as an opaque connection error.
#
# `npm test` needs it too: the repository tests query the live Neon branch.
#
# Where to get one: https://neon.com -> new project -> copy the pooled
# connection string. See README.md.
DATABASE_URL=
